{"text":"kuruntokai","n":399,"lines":["ஊருண் கேணி யுண்டுறைக் தொக்க","பாசி யற்றே பசலை காதலர்","தொடுவுழித் தொடுவுழி நீங்கி","விடுவுழி விடுவுழிப் பரத்த லானே"],"tr":["ūruṇ kēṇi yuṇṭuṟaik tokka","pāci yaṟṟē pacalai kātalar","toṭuvuḻit toṭuvuḻi nīṅki","viṭuvuḻi viṭuvuḻip paratta lāṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"marutam","tinai_ta":"மருதம்","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"பரணர்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Paraṇar"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"4 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 4"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"ஊருண்","tr":"ūruṇ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஊ","tr":"ū"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ருண்","tr":"ruṇ"}]},{"text":"கேணி","tr":"kēṇi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கே","tr":"kē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணி","tr":"ṇi"}]},{"text":"யுண்டுறைக்","tr":"yuṇṭuṟaik","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யுண்","tr":"yuṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுறைக்","tr":"ṭuṟaik"}]},{"text":"தொக்க","tr":"tokka","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தொக்","tr":"tok"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"க","tr":"ka"}]}],[{"text":"பாசி","tr":"pāci","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பா","tr":"pā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"சி","tr":"ci"}]},{"text":"யற்றே","tr":"yaṟṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யற்","tr":"yaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]},{"text":"பசலை","tr":"pacalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பச","tr":"paca"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"காதலர்","tr":"kātalar","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தலர்","tr":"talar"}]}],[{"text":"தொடுவுழித்","tr":"toṭuvuḻit","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொடு","tr":"toṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுழித்","tr":"vuḻit"}]},{"text":"தொடுவுழி","tr":"toṭuvuḻi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தொடு","tr":"toṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுழி","tr":"vuḻi"}]},{"text":"நீங்கி","tr":"nīṅki","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நீங்","tr":"nīṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கி","tr":"ki"}]}],[{"text":"விடுவுழி","tr":"viṭuvuḻi","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விடு","tr":"viṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுழி","tr":"vuḻi"}]},{"text":"விடுவுழிப்","tr":"viṭuvuḻip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விடு","tr":"viṭu"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வுழிப்","tr":"vuḻip"}]},{"text":"பரத்த","tr":"paratta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பரத்","tr":"parat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"லானே","tr":"lāṉē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"லா","tr":"lā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஊருண்","parts":[{"text":"ஊர்","lemma":"ஊர்","gloss":"town"},{"text":"உண்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"drink"}],"gloss":"drunk by the town"},{"surface":"கேணி","parts":[{"text":"கேணி","lemma":"கேணி","gloss":"well"}],"gloss":"well"},{"surface":"யுண்டுறைக்","parts":[{"text":"ய்","lemma":"ய்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"உண்டுறை","lemma":"உண்டுறை","gloss":"drinking ghat"},{"text":"க்","lemma":"க்","gloss":"sandhi"}],"gloss":"at the drinking ghat"},{"surface":"தொக்க","parts":[{"text":"தொக்க","lemma":"தொகு","gloss":"gathered"}],"gloss":"gathered"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பாசி","parts":[{"text":"பாசி","lemma":"பாசி","gloss":"water-moss"}],"gloss":"water-moss"},{"surface":"யற்றே","parts":[{"text":"ய்","lemma":"ய்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"அற்று","lemma":"அற்று","gloss":"like"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis"}],"gloss":"is just like"},{"surface":"பசலை","parts":[{"text":"பசலை","lemma":"பசலை","gloss":"pallor"}],"gloss":"pallor"},{"surface":"காதலர்","parts":[{"text":"காதலர்","lemma":"காதலர்","gloss":"lover"}],"gloss":"lover"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தொடுவுழித்","parts":[{"text":"தொடு","lemma":"தொடு","gloss":"touch"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"உழி","lemma":"உழி","gloss":"place/time"},{"text":"த்","lemma":"த்","gloss":"sandhi"}],"gloss":"whenever touched"},{"surface":"தொடுவுழி","parts":[{"text":"தொடு","lemma":"தொடு","gloss":"touch"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"உழி","lemma":"உழி","gloss":"place/time"}],"gloss":"whenever touched"},{"surface":"நீங்கி","parts":[{"text":"நீங்கி","lemma":"நீங்கு","gloss":"receding"}],"gloss":"receding"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"விடுவுழி","parts":[{"text":"விடு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"leave"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"உழி","lemma":"உழி","gloss":"place/time"}],"gloss":"whenever left"},{"surface":"விடுவுழிப்","parts":[{"text":"விடு","lemma":"விடு","gloss":"leave"},{"text":"வ்","lemma":"வ்","gloss":"glide"},{"text":"உழி","lemma":"உழி","gloss":"place/time"},{"text":"ப்","lemma":"ப்","gloss":"sandhi"}],"gloss":"whenever left"},{"surface":"பரத்த","parts":[{"text":"பரத்த","lemma":"பரத்தல்","gloss":"spreading"}],"gloss":"spreading"},{"surface":"லானே","parts":[{"text":"லானே","lemma":"ஆல்","gloss":"because of"}],"gloss":"because of"}]}],"literal":"Like the water-moss gathered at the drinking-ghat of the common well drunk by the town, / is the pallor. My lover, / whenever and wherever he touches, it recedes, / and whenever and wherever he leaves, because of its spreading.","translation":"My pallor is just like the water-moss that gathers at the drinking-ghat of the common well drunk by the town: whenever my lover touches me, it recedes; the moment he leaves, it spreads all over.","modern":"ஊர் மக்கள் குடிக்கும் கிணற்றின் நீர் உண்ணும் துறையில் குவிந்திருக்கும் பாசியைப் போன்றது என் உடலின் பசலை நிறம். காதலர் தொடும் போதெல்லாம் அது விலகிப் போகிறது; அவர் கையை எடுக்கும் போதெல்லாம் அது மீண்டும் பரவி விடுகிறது.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to her companion about the agonizing nature of her love-sickness. She compares her spreading pallor to the water-moss in a busy public well. Just as the moss parts when a vessel is dipped to draw water and immediately closes back when the vessel is removed, her pallor disappears the moment her lover touches her, only to return instantly when he lets go. This vivid image from the agricultural landscape perfectly captures the fleeting relief of union and the immediate return of the pain of separation. The key words are 'pāci' (moss), 'pasalai' (pallor), 'toṭuvuḻi' (whenever touched), and 'viṭuvuḻi' (whenever left).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.85],[0.85,1.3],[1.3,1.6],[1.7,2.3],[2.3,2.3],[2.3,2.7],[2.7,3.1],[3.1,3.25],[3.4,5.0],[5.0,5.3],[5.3,5.37],[5.4,6.59],[6.59,6.59],[6.59,7.3]],"female":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.85],[0.85,1.4],[1.4,1.7],[1.8,2.7],[2.7,2.8],[2.8,3.3],[3.3,3.7],[3.7,4.96],[4.96,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.95],[7.2,7.58],[7.7,8.2],[8.2,8.3]]},"sync":[[["ஊருண்","drunk by the town"]],[["கேணி","well"]],[["யுண்டுறைக்","at the drinking ghat"]],[["தொக்க","gathered"]],[["பாசி","water-moss"]],[["யற்றே","is just like"]],[["பசலை","pallor"]],[["காதலர்","lover"]],[["தொடுவுழித்","whenever touched"]],[["தொடுவுழி","whenever touched"]],[["நீங்கி","receding"]],[["விடுவுழி","whenever left"]],[["விடுவுழிப்","whenever left"]],[["பரத்த","spreading"]],[["லானே","because of"]]]}